        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPR-212, Solid Brass 2 Rectangular Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis little finger pull is for use on small doors or drawers such as on closet doors, dresser drawers, and cabinets. The modern Small Rectangular Finger Ring Pull will add contemporary flair to any space. It is made from solid brass and can be finished in any one of 5 colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-inch-rectangular-finger-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpr-320\">Large Rectangular Finger Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Rectangular RPR212 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Length: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Wdith: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
